  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "dissectors: various fixes to sysdig packet dissector and updated sysdig events",
  "description": "* avoid sigsegv when sysdig event has a number of params that is greater of the wireshark one. Adding params to existing events is recentish-ly supported by sysdig; avoid breaking in those cases.\n* fixed check for `BLOCK_TYPE_SYSDIG_EVENT_V2_LARGE`\n* updated and fixed `generate-sysdig-event` tool\n* used the updated `generate-sysdig-event` to generate a fresh list of sysdig events\n\nSigned-off-by: Federico Di Pierro <nierro92@gmail.com>",
